Fonts shipped with the canvas

A thread's canvas is the Excalidraw editor (@excalidraw/excalidraw 0.18.1, MIT). The Inbox window packs the drawing
fonts that package carries (build/excalidraw-local.ts copies them from the package's dist/prod/fonts at build time; none
is in this repository's source tree) and serves them from /assets/excalidraw/fonts/. They are not covered by this
repository's MIT or Apache license; each family's own terms follow. Xiaolai is not shipped.

